      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "other"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The township once stretched six miles square, except for a few hundred acres cut from the northwest corner by the Mississippi River, with Rock River flowing through its center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
